    "The old->new map for the 2026-08-02 clean-room reorganisation.",
    "Rules are applied in order and the FIRST match wins, so specific file",
    "rules must precede the directory rule that would otherwise sweep them up.",
    "'file' matches one exact path. 'dir' matches any path under that prefix and",
    "rewrites the prefix. 'delete' removes the path (file or whole directory).",
    "docs/design/PROJECT_LAYOUT.md carries the rationale for every line."
